DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T150000
UID:69e2a5f5e7c57a539c135fe2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Interested in learning more about volunteering opportunities i
 n Toronto?\nThis session is intended for the volunteer seekers who are new
  to volunteering\, or in need to understand the process of formal voluntee
 ring. Join us to learn how and where to search for opportunities that best
  match your interests and what to expect after you apply for a volunteer r
 ole.\nThis session caters to all demographics.\nPresented by\nVolunteer To
 ronto\n.
